{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:02.98] Lost (Uh, uh)\n[00:04.12] I lost, I lost (Uh, oh)\n[00:07.10] I lost, I lost (Trapped)\n[Chorus]\n[00:12.02] Lost my mind, trapped in me\n[00:18.46] I don't know what's happening\n[00:24.40] I've been space-traveling\n[00:29.96] Tryna find some inner peace, inner peace\n[Verse 1]\n[00:36.72] Welcome to my abyss\n[00:38.96] Filled with sins and trifling\n[00:41.96] Fake friends, I hate them\n[00:44.24] Delete them all, erase them\n[00:48.22] I'm getting lost in my abyss\n[00:50.94] Trials, tribulations, and suffering\n[00:54.00] Mayhem will break them\n[00:56.28] Words from the evil faces\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[01:02.98] Drugs will fade them (Away)\n[01:05.66] Pop three, I lace them (Away, away, away)\n[01:12.26] Welcome to my abyss (Welcome, welcome, welcome)\n[01:18.04] Pain and suffering (Welcome, welcome, oh, welcome)\n[Chorus]\n[01:24.58] Lost my mind, trapped in me\n[01:30.46] I don't know what's happening\n[01:36.40] I've been space-traveling\n[01:41.96] Tryna find some inner peace, inner peace\n[Verse 2]\n[01:47.76] It's pain in those words, you can hear it when I talk\n[01:50.98] But what's a life to live if you ain't got no risk involved?\n[01:53.96] And what's a slit to make if you ain't got no wrist involved?\n[01:56.74] Mixin' pills with the liquor, fuck, I'm finna risk it all\n[01:59.70] Still a cool dude, too smooth, just like olive oil\n[02:02.70] Known to pop pills, pop niggas, and pop ollies, boy\n[02:05.66] And pop wheelies, ghost ride it, my mind is enlightened\n[02:08.84] I'm high as the highest, don't need no ghostwriter\n[02:11.72] Bitch, I speak for myself, but my health ain't my wealth\n[02:14.52] 'Cause I'm rich in my bank, but I'm bad with myself\n[02:17.78] Bombin' like a kamikaze, I'm the shit to these hoes\n[02:20.64] I set the play, these niggas flock, they settin' picks for me, ho\n[02:23.62] I came in killin', I'm really fuckin' the industry up\n[02:26.54] These niggas shady, they really leavin' me mentally fucked\n[02:29.68] Trapped inside the abyss with a bad bitch in the front\n[02:32.56] With a blunt in my mouth and some purple codeine in the cup (What?)\n[Bridge]\n[02:36.12] Spazzin' on they ass in all type of ways\n[02:39.10] Pop a couple Percs to take my life away\n[02:41.82] Nah, just a lighter day, just a brighter day\n[02:45.40] She doin' all the lines, she had a whiter day, uh\n[02:49.26] Freestylin', no writers, ayy\n[02:51.34] That mean when the songs come out I get paid\n[02:54.90] No cuts, give no fucks\n[02:57.46] I show out before I even go and show up\n[Verse 3]\n[03:00.54] So what? I drink Henny 'til I throw up\n[03:03.58] So what? It's red lean in that white cup\n[03:06.56] Pull up on 'em like, beep, that's a tow truck\n[03:09.48] Choppa on me like, damn, nigga, don't duck\n[03:12.50] Duck, goose when I catch 'em\n[03:14.76] Niggas askin' questions, stop throwin' hatchets\n[03:17.78] Never had a father, always been a bastard\n[03:20.76] Fuck with me, I'll beat your ass, your head is in a plaster\n[03:23.44] They don't make sense like spelling \"rich\" backwards, I'm madder\n[03:27.14] Run up, that's okay, your head is on a platter\n[03:29.82] Outta space off the codeine, I'm on Saturn\n[03:33.14] Niggas got it backwards, dyslexic patterns, pff\n[03:36.48] I don't believe in you niggas, a nigga atheist\n[03:39.14] Say this, I spray it, say it, don't spray it, I'll spray it, don't say it\n[03:43.64] Presidential brain from your main, S. Palin\n[03:46.66] Pull up on the scene, judge a nigga, no bailiff\n[03:49.66] Flow go cold, shine like VVS, nigga, fuck rose gold\n[03:53.80] It's like $50k inside my wardrobe\n[03:57.02] I get new bitches, these niggas fuck worn hoes\n[04:00.20] You a whore, ho, you know it, I don't gotta say it\n[04:03.16] Pull up on the scene, my choppa just like Alizée\n[04:06.12] Poppin' like a bottle, I fuck on a model\n[04:09.20] I don't wanna fuck if that bitch don't plan to swallow\n[04:12.16] I told her boyfriend he could swallow all the hollows\n[04:14.80] Don't believe me, send your location, I'll be there tomorrow (I'll be there tomorrow)\n[Chorus]\n[04:24.02] Lost my mind, trapped in me\n[04:30.46] I don't know what's happening\n[04:34.24] I've been space-traveling\n[04:41.96] Tryna find some inner peace, inner peace","words":[[2.0,2.64,"[Intro]"],[2.66,2.76,"[00:04.54]"],[2.98,3.76,"Lost"],[3.8,3.82,"(Uh,"],[3.86,3.94,"uh)"],[3.96,4.06,"[00:05.56]"],[4.12,4.12,"I"],[4.54,5.3,"lost,"],[5.56,5.56,"I"],[5.7,6.74,"lost"],[6.78,6.8,"(Uh,"],[6.84,7.0,"oh)"],[7.02,7.04,"[00:08.50]"],[7.1,7.1,"I"],[7.46,8.26,"lost,"],[8.5,8.5,"I"],[8.6,9.06,"lost"],[10.14,10.9,"(Trapped)"],[10.94,11.42,"[Chorus]"],[11.44,11.9,"[00:12.02]"],[12.02,12.48,"Lost"],[12.58,12.92,"my"],[13.1,14.92,"mind,"],[14.96,15.58,"trapped"],[15.68,15.92,"in"],[16.14,16.26,"me"],[16.28,18.18,"[00:18.46]"],[18.46,18.46,"I"],[18.58,18.94,"don't"],[18.98,19.54,"know"],[19.9,20.9,"what's"],[21.0,22.64,"happening"],[22.66,24.24,"[00:24.40]"],[24.4,24.52,"I've"],[24.56,24.86,"been"],[25.04,28.46,"space-traveling"],[28.48,29.1,"[00:29.96]"],[29.96,30.66,"Tryna"],[31.1,32.36,"find"],[32.58,33.08,"some"],[33.34,33.7,"inner"],[34.12,34.88,"peace,"],[34.98,35.54,"inner"],[35.6,36.1,"peace"],[36.14,36.22,"[Verse"],[36.24,36.3,"1]"],[36.3,36.52,"[00:36.72]"],[36.72,37.24,"Welcome"],[37.28,37.34,"to"],[37.48,37.98,"my"],[38.06,38.62,"abyss"],[38.64,38.82,"[00:38.96]"],[38.96,39.36,"Filled"],[39.5,39.64,"with"],[39.72,40.24,"sins"],[40.32,40.38,"and"],[40.46,41.54,"trifling"],[41.56,41.68,"[00:41.96]"],[41.96,42.4,"Fake"],[42.52,42.9,"friends,"],[43.0,43.0,"I"],[43.16,43.56,"hate"],[43.66,44.0,"them"],[44.02,44.12,"[00:44.24]"],[44.24,44.62,"Delete"],[44.72,44.9,"them"],[45.1,45.38,"all,"],[45.68,46.62,"erase"],[46.7,47.1,"them"],[47.12,47.66,"[00:48.22]"],[48.22,48.28,"I'm"],[48.38,48.86,"getting"],[48.92,49.12,"lost"],[49.2,49.22,"in"],[49.4,49.98,"my"],[50.08,50.64,"abyss"],[50.66,50.78,"[00:50.94]"],[50.94,51.54,"Trials,"],[51.66,52.32,"t